<title>USA: Pride Petroleum to sell well-servicing operations.</title>
<headline>Pride Petroleum to sell well-servicing operations.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pride Petroleum Services Inc on Monday said it signed a definitive agreement to sell its U.S. land-based well-servicing operations to Dawson Production Services Inc for $135.9 million in cash.</p>
</text>
